        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARVESTED</strong> is a horror game in which you need to escape using items scattered around the map as you progress through the story. But be careful, you're not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique entities to face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many random events that keep you on your toes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items and structures needed to escape are randomized each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of achievements and trophies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNPREDICTABLE RUNS EVERY TIME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with entities and their <strong>unique</strong> abilities. Items and map layouts are always randomized!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND UTILIZE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and use <strong>items</strong> to unlock new areas of the map and complete objectives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cosmetics to try out!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HARVESTED</strong> is a horror game in which you need to escape using items scattered around the map as you progress through the story. But be careful, you're not alone here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/5152a275f0477c20ddf33e86a09ae508.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many unique entities to face</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many random events that keep you on your toes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All items and structures needed to escape are randomized each run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of achievements and trophies</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNPREDICTABLE RUNS EVERY TIME!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/44c22c600323195af16933f93c5bfff5.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deal with entities and their <strong>unique</strong> abilities. Items and map layouts are always randomized!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE AND UTILIZE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/eb6617e344810f43a8d120a4025d912c.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and use <strong>items</strong> to unlock new areas of the map and complete objectives!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZE YOUR CHARACTER!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.poster.avif?t=1786515037\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.webm?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829180/extras/cb17e55cf5b9b74d671ba87cc60f7046.mp4?t=1786515037\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bunch of cosmetics to try out!</p>",
